GNU DataExplorer - News - comes with Version 4.0.5 - 14 May 2026

Generic changes/fixes 
	* fix upgrade dialog resize problem (ARM 64)
	* enable error message box while detecting error from jSerialComm
	* enable MacOS ARM build
	* enable storing/deleting zoom steps per recordSet, enable switching  between this steps
	* add one time action correct the cool bar due to re-organization 
	* enable KMZ export using the globe with relativeToGround as well as with absolute altitude
	* update documentation
	
Device specific changes/fixes
	* UT61E - correct unexpected behavior
	* UT71D - add initial support
	* IGCAdapter - adaptation for task statistics of Albatross v4.4.4+
	* HoTTAdapter* - update value changes according GPS-Logger FW >= 1.32
			
Allgemeine Änderungen/Korrekturen
	* fix upgrade dialog resize problem (ARM 64)
	* enable error message box while detecting error from jSerialComm
	* enable MacOS ARM build
	* enable storing/deleting zoom steps per recordSet, enable switching  between this steps
	* add one time action correct the cool bar due to re-organization 
	* enable KMZ export using the globe with relativeToGround as well as with absolute altitude
	* update documentation

Gerätespezifische Änderungen
	* UT61E - unerwartetes Verhalten korrigiert
	* UT71D - initiale Geräteunterstützung
	* IGCAdapter - Anpassung der Statistik für Albatross v4.4.4+
	* HoTTAdapter* - Anpassung geänderter Werte SM GPS-Logger FW >= 1.32
